On Sun, 16 Jun 2002, Pierre Abbat wrote:

> Please check for any silly errors I may have made.

I've looked to suggested country names list through my syntax.vim tool.
Some formal morphology errors was highlighted. The most common one is
a misusing the "la" syllable in cmene:

    la .angoLAs
    la brunais darusaLAm
    la kaLAlit nunat
    la guatemaLAs
    la .eLAn vanin
    la sriLAnkas
    la LAibirias
    la meLAium
    la suaziLAnd
    la venezueLAs

Also forbidden consonsnt pairs occurs in some suggested names:

    la bosnias joik xerTZegovinas
    la leTVias
    la SValbard joik .ian maien dapl

Following gismu aren't recognized:

    le nuzlo
    le zvero

